                                        <p>
                                            <p>Jamuna Apartments by {developer_name} at Daun Majra Mohali making headlines in the {property_status} projects segment in Mohali for the various meticulously Residential options.&nbsp;The Jamuna Apartments is a {property_status} Apartments Project, which offers {sizes_available} options with the size range between {size_range}. This project by {developer_name} is conveniently priced starting from {price_range} and is ideally located to ensure comfort and a higher living quotient for its buyers.</p>

<p>The Jamuna Apartments offers Residential Apartments {total_units} units with top-class specifications that meet the expectations of the lifestyle of the urban population, It is spread across the {project_area} of land. Jamuna Apartments Location has excellent connectivity with major part of the Mohali &amp; it is located at the heart of the Daun Majra. The Amenities at Jamuna Apartments include a fully equipped clubhouse, gardens, gymnasium, swimming pool, outdoor activity, and children&rsquo;s play area with utmost importance to state-of-the-art 24/7 security.</p>
                                    </p>
